WEBVTT

00:11:59.006 --> 00:12:03.969
It is time our stories
and our policies reflect this.

00:12:03.969 --> 00:12:05.929
We can change the narrative.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.182
And when we do,

00:12:08.182 --> 00:12:12.978
the world will be a much better
and equitable place for us all.

00:12:12.978 --> 00:12:14.146
Thank you.

00:12:14.188 --> 00:12:20.819
(Applause and cheers)